dotdot: begin
~dotdot: / dev 254:2 ino 2, /.. dev 254:2 ino 2
dotdot: / and /.. one directory: yes
dotdot: chdir(/..) = 0
dotdot: getcwd after chdir(/..): /
dotdot: chdir(/etc) = 0
dotdot: chdir(../../..) = 0
dotdot: getcwd after chdir(../../..) from /etc: /
dotdot: . is /: yes
dotdot: open(/../etc/../etc/motd) = 3
~dotdot: / lists 10 names (d0d5c7f2fbab33be), /.. 10 (d0d5c7f2fbab33be)
dotdot: /.. lists what / lists: yes
dotdot: openat(/etc, ../..) = a descriptor
dotdot: it is /: yes
dotdot: chroot(/) = 0
dotdot: getcwd after chroot(/): /
dotdot: end
